sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Device as Medical Device
    participant EST as EstController
    participant Orch as EnrollmentOrchestrator
    participant DB as Gateway Database
    participant Notify as NotificationDispatcher
    participant SMTP as SMTP Sender
    actor Recipient as Notification Recipient

    Device->>EST: Submit enrollment or re-enrollment request
    EST->>Orch: EnrollAsync or ReenrollAsync
    Orch->>DB: Load profile, device, certificate, and policy state

    alt First enrollment rejected
        Orch->>DB: Insert EnrollmentEvent(status=Rejected, reason)
        Orch->>Notify: NotifyEnrollmentRejectedAsync(operation=Enrollment)
    else Re-enrollment rejected
        Note over Orch,DB: Re-enrollment rejection currently sends notification but does not persist a rejected EnrollmentEvent.
        Orch->>Notify: NotifyEnrollmentRejectedAsync(operation=Re-enrollment)
    end

    Notify->>DB: Load notification settings
    DB-->>Notify: Settings

    alt Notifications disabled or event unsubscribed
        Notify-->>Orch: Return without sending
    else Notifications enabled
        Notify->>DB: Load recipients subscribed to EnrollmentRejected
        DB-->>Notify: Recipients

        alt No recipients
            Notify-->>Orch: Return without sending
        else Recipients exist
            Notify->>SMTP: Send rejection email
            SMTP-->>Recipient: Email with subject DN, device id, IP, time, and reason
            SMTP-->>Notify: Send complete
        end
    end

    Orch-->>EST: Failed(reason, statusCode)
    EST-->>Device: JSON error response
